        },
        {
          "text": "I kom nucu man ma obedo pi lwak Moses okwanyo iye acel ki i kom pyerabic, i kom dano ki i kom lee, ci omiyogi bot Lulevi ma gigwoko kema pa Rwot, macalo Rwot ocike kwede.",
