          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci doŋ wakelo gityerwa bot Rwot, gin ma dano acel acel onoŋo i lweny, jami me jabu, mola bad, atego ŋut ciŋ, agit ciŋ ki tiko nut, pi kwanyo bal ki i komwa i nyim Rwot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar gugamo jabu meno ki botgi; gin ducu obedo jami me deyo kom ma gitiyo ki diro ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jabu ducu ma lulo dano alip ki lulo dano miya gutyero bot Rwot pekke oromo makato ratili miya aŋwen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo lulweny ducu guyako jami, ŋat acel acel pire kene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses ki ajwaka gugamo jabu ki bot ludito wi mony, gutero i kema me rwatte obed gin me poyo wi Rwot i kom jo Icrael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
